puff (the inflate decoder of the FT812 follows it)
  Copyright (C) 2002-2013 Mark Adler. zlib License.

MAME Sprinter driver (the Sprinter Sp2000 model follows it and the MAME
Z84C015 / Z80 CTC / Z80 SIO devices) and MAME Spectrum Next driver (the ZX
Spectrum Next model, web/web_nx.cpp, follows it and the Next's documentation
at wiki.specnext.dev: Z80N, memory, registers, layers, copper, DMA, DivMMC)
