SAASound (the SAA1099 follows it: the latches of the generators, the
envelope, the noise, the mixer and its tables)
  Copyright (c) 1998-2025 Dave Hooper, Simon Owen. BSD 3-Clause License:
  redistributions must keep the copyright notice, this condition and the
  disclaimer of the BSD 3-Clause License (the same text as for sjasmplus
