  promote derived products without permission.
  https://github.com/stripwax/SAASound

SAM Coupe is written for this port from the SAM Coupe Technical Manual;
SimCoupe (Simon Owen) and the MAME driver (both GPL) were read for the
hardware's behavior only, no code is taken from them. The SAM Coupe ROM 3.0
is Dr Andy Wright's, distributed with his kind permission (as SimCoupe
distributes it).

ROM images (the rom/ folder of the site), disk, HDD and SD card images
and other software that the emulator loads are not covered by this license.
They belong to their copyright holders, among them: the GMX flash of LW / PLM
(GMX Loader, Shadow Service Monitor of MOA), OSZ by izzx
(https://github.com/izzx-git/OSZ), NedoOS by Alone Coder and the NedoOS team,
TS-BIOS and Wild Commander, TR-DOS, the Sprinter BIOS and Estex DSS of Peters
Plus and the Sprinter Team (BIOS 3.06, Estex DSS 1.71), the Sprinter programs
on hdd/dss.zip (the system.zip of the Sprinter Team update 3.06, Flex Navigator,
TASM and GFX Viewer of Anton Enin, FM of Vasil Ivanov, WAVPLAY, the games, demos
and tools of their authors), the BIOS and ROMs of the machines.

ZX Spectrum Next: NextZXOS (enNextZX.rom, Garry Lancaster), esxDOS for the Next
(enNxtmmc.rom), the Multiface ROM (enNextMf.rom) and the System/Next
distribution on the SD card (sd/next.zip)
